{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a gas station attendant working the graveyard shift. At first, it\u2019s just another quiet night\u2014until unsettling strangers begin to appear one after another. Their presence feels wrong. Their stories don\u2019t add up. And with each encounter, your grip on reality slips further away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay at the Pump</strong> is a psychological horror game inspired by the eerie atmosphere of early 2000s survival horror classics. Explore your station, serve suspicious customers, and uncover what lies beneath the surface of a seemingly ordinary night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror with retro-inspired 3D visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration and interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsettling encounters with disturbing characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven experience with a shocking twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fans of psychological and survival horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the night\u2014or discover the truth too late?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011720?t=1757951491","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011720?t=1757951491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011720/23d0632ca454deae5e33f6571072af229a8ced49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757951491","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011720/23d0632ca454deae5e33f6571072af229a8ced49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757951491","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains disturbing content and themes that may not be suitable for all players. It includes strong psychological horror, depictions of violence, blood, and unsettling imagery. The story also touches on sensitive topics such as mental instability, loss, and family tragedy. There are no sexual or sexually abusive themes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a gas station attendant working the graveyard shift. At first, it\u2019s just another quiet night\u2014until unsettling strangers begin to appear one after another. Their presence feels wrong. Their stories don\u2019t add up. And with each encounter, your grip on reality slips further away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay at the Pump</strong> is a psychological horror game inspired by the eerie atmosphere of early 2000s survival horror classics. Explore your station, serve suspicious customers, and uncover what lies beneath the surface of a seemingly ordinary night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror with retro-inspired 3D visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration and interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsettling encounters with disturbing characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven experience with a shocking twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fans of psychological and survival horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the night\u2014or discover the truth too late?</p>","developers":["Lemon Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011720/5fa35b9979416e10fccd95432ac47cf641baf770/header.jpg?t=1757951491","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommend